---
const steps = [
  {
    title: 'Discover',
    description:
      "We talk through your business, your goals and what your website needs to do. You get a clear plan and price.",
  },
  {
    title: 'Design & Build',
    description:
      "I design and build your website so it looks right on every device and does what your customers need.",
  },
  {
    title: 'Review & Refine',
    description:
      "You review it, share your feedback and I make the changes. Your package includes a set number of revisions.",
  },
  {
    title: 'Launch & Support',
    description:
      "Once you're happy, the final payment is made and your website goes live. I'll help you choose a care plan to keep it secure and up to date.",
  },
];
---

<section id="process" aria-labelledby="pr">
  <div class="section-head">
    <h2 id="pr">How it works</h2>
    <p>
      Getting your business online shouldn't be complicated.
      My straightforward four-step process keeps you involved
      from the initial conversation right through to launch and beyond.
    </p>
  </div>

  <ol class="timeline">
    {steps.map((step) => (
      <li>
        <h3>{step.title}</h3>
        <p>{step.description}</p>
      </li>
    ))}
  </ol>
</section>